    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1806">

                <pb facs="1461" n="1345" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1345"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 367.11/8.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-05T14:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 5, 1912—2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs assures me that adequate protection will be
                    given our schools at Scutari and Robert College. I am investigating, through the
                    captain of the <hi rendition="#italic">Scorpion</hi> the measures taken by the
                    Turkish authorities; if necessary I shall add to the protection with some of our
                    sailors. The pupils in the schools, mostly of Greek and Bulgarian nationalities,
                    are under the protection of Russia and France. The Americans have ail been told
                    where to take refuge in case of need. I hope to be able to protect them, but if
                    necessary I will ask aid of neutral vessels. I consider it prudent to keep all
                    Americans living in the outskirts as long as possible in Robert College. As we
                    have no ships here I am not consulted by my colleagues, who have conferred as to
                    plans for their own use.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
